OL,3,GNEWSANew store plans facing Tesco
OL,4,Achallenge, says Lidl boss
OL,5,
OL,6,FSupermarket giant Lidl says it has been
OL,7,Finformed rival chain Tesco intends to
OL,8,Flaunch a legal challenge against its
OL,9,Fplan to build a new store in
OL,10,FLondonderry.
OL,12,FPlans to build the store at Crescent
OL,13,FLink in Derry's Waterside were first
OL,14,Fsubmitted in 2021 and given the green
OL,15,Flight earlier this year by
OL,16,FInfrastructure Minister Liz Kimmins.
OL,18,FBut Lidl said it has now learned that
OL,19,FTesco has written to the Department for
OL,20,FInfrastructure (DfI) requesting
OL,21,Fpermission to challenge the store's
OL,22,Fministerial approval.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
