OL,3,GNEWSANew store plans facing Tesco
OL,4,Achallenge, says Lidl boss
OL,5,
OL,6,FThat challenge, Lidl said, could
OL,7,Fjeopardise millions of pounds of
OL,8,Finvestment in the north west region as
OL,9,Fwell as the creation of hundreds of new
OL,10,Fjobs.
